WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.900
Just Speak to It is now on Windows, in beta. Everything here is sample data.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:10.900
The dashboard shows your shortcut, model and latest text.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:16.067
Press Ctrl+Alt+Space in any app to start.

00:00:16.067 --> 00:00:19.467
A small overlay shows the words as you speak.

00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:23.733
Stop, and the text goes back into the window you were in.

00:00:23.733 --> 00:00:31.067
Settings cover the microphone, text output, and the speak CLI and MCP server.

00:00:31.067 --> 00:00:35.033
Download the Windows beta at justspeaktoit.com.
